# Documentation not needed by the image build. The assets the crates embed
# (/assets/places/, basemap/, reference/, themes/, portraits/, fonts/,
# brand/logo_64.b64, desktop/) stay in the context; the logo images and the
# screenshots are left out.
/docs/
/assets/brand/*.png
/assets/brand/*.svg
/assets/screenshots/
/charts/
*.md
/.gitignore

